{"sourceUrl":"https://me.bit.edu.cn/tzgg/f20da39c0bdf402297a3c978668fc2d7.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:47.715966+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://me.bit.edu.cn/tzgg/f20da39c0bdf402297a3c978668fc2d7.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>欢迎国内高校优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读北京理工大学机械与车辆学院研究生！</span></p>\n<p><span>一、申请条件</span></p>\n<p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.学习期间未受过任何处分。身心健康，符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></p>\n<p><span>3.已获得所在高校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p>\n<p><span>4.勤奋好学，思维敏捷，专业基础知识扎实，具有较强的实践能力和创新能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>二、招生专业</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）硕士招生专业</span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>专业代码</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专业名称</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>方向码</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>研究方向名称</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>080200</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>01</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>车辆理论与无人系统</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>02</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>智能电动车辆与交能融合</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>03</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>智能制造与高端装备</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>05</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>具身机电系统与智能交互</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>06</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>激光制造与增材制造</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>0802J1</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>工业与系统工程</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>01</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>知识工程与产品创新设计</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>02</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>生产与服务系统工程</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>03</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>人因与可靠性工程</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>04</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>工业系统建模与仿真</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>0802J2</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>光机电微纳制造</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>01</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>激光微/纳制造理论与应用</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><s